---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Bully Legion KaapStad | Same Blood. Higher Standards." description="A Cape Town American Bully programme focused on welfare, sound structure, and transparent records.">
	<section class="hero">
		<img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1580060839134-75a5edca2e99?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1800&q=85" alt="Table Mountain above Cape Town" />
		<div class="hero-shade"></div>
		<div class="container hero-copy">
			<p class="eyebrow">Cape Town, South Africa</p>
			<h1 class="display">Same blood.<br />Higher standards.</h1>
			<p class="hero-text">A considered American Bully programme built around welfare, sound structure, stable temperament, and transparent records.</p>
			<div class="hero-actions"><a class="button primary" href="/care">Care & tools</a><a class="button secondary" href="/about">Our approach</a></div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="intro container">
		<div><p class="eyebrow">The BLK standard</p><h2 class="display">Cape Town roots.<br />A legacy in the making.</h2></div>
		<p>BLK exists to develop healthy, stable American Bullies through thoughtful selection and responsible ownership. We share the work behind the dogs: records, education, care, and the long view.</p>
	</section>

	<section class="paths">
		<div class="container path-grid">
			<a href="/studs"><span>01</span><strong>Studs</strong><small>Profiles and records</small></a>
			<a href="/females"><span>02</span><strong>Females</strong><small>Profiles and records</small></a>
			<a href="/care"><span>03</span><strong>Care & tools</strong><small>Practical owner guidance</small></a>
		</div>
	</section>
</Layout>

<style>
	.hero { position: relative; display: grid; align-items: end; min-height: min(760px, calc(100vh - 76px)); overflow: hidden; background: var(--obsidian); color: var(--ivory); }
	.hero > img, .hero-shade { position: absolute; inset: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; }
	.hero > img { object-fit: cover; object-position: center; filter: saturate(0.7) contrast(1.08); }
	.hero-shade { background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(23,24,23,0.94) 0%, rgba(23,24,23,0.56) 47%, rgba(23,24,23,0.1) 100%); }
	.hero-copy { position: relative; z-index: 1; padding: 5rem 0; }
	.hero h1 { max-width: 700px; margin: 0; font-size: clamp(4.8rem, 10vw, 9.4rem); }
	.hero-text { max-width: 510px; margin: 1.25rem 0 0; color: rgba(232,225,213,0.82); font-size: 1.05rem; }
	.hero-actions { display: flex; gap: 0.75rem; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: 2rem; }
	.intro { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr minmax(0, 0.65fr); gap: 4rem; padding: 7rem 0; }
	.intro h2 { margin: 0; font-size: clamp(3rem, 6vw, 5.5rem); }
	.intro > p { align-self: end; margin: 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: 1.1rem; }
	.paths { background: var(--charcoal); color: var(--ivory); }
	.path-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); }
	.path-grid a { display: grid; gap: 0.45rem; min-height: 205px; padding: 2rem; border-right: 1px solid var(--line); transition: background 180ms ease; }
	.path-grid a:hover { background: var(--bronze); color: var(--obsidian); }
	.path-grid span { color: var(--bronze); font-size: 0.9rem; font-weight: 700; }
	.path-grid a:hover span { color: var(--obsidian); }
	.path-grid strong { font-family: var(--display); font-size: 2.5rem; line-height: 1; }
	.path-grid small { color: rgba(232,225,213,0.7); }
	.path-grid a:hover small { color: rgba(23,24,23,0.75); }
	@media (max-width: 700px) { .hero { min-height: 620px; } .hero-copy { padding: 3rem 0; } .hero h1 { font-size: clamp(4rem, 20vw, 5.8rem); } .intro { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 1.5rem; padding: 4rem 0; } .path-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .path-grid a { min-height: 150px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); } }
</style>
